#! rate=44118 block=128 tracks=4
# 12 Clip launches (R11). While playing, a launch queues to the master bar,
# where the playhead goes to the loop start, the carry resets and the cycle
# restarts at 1; launching an empty slot, or stoptrk, stops the track at the
# bar. From stopped, a launch starts the transport and also restarts every
# track whose playing slot survived Stop (kept as Movy has it, docs/13 §3.3).
@0 tog 0 0 60 100
@0 tog 0 8 64 100
@0 clipsel 0 1
@0 tog 0 0 72 100
@0 tog 0 4 74 100
@0 clen 0 8
@0 clipsel 0 0
@0 tog 1 0 48 100
@0 tog 1 8 50 100
@0 tog 2 4 55 100
@0 econd 2 4 4 -1 1 2
@0 play
@30000 launch 0 1
@30000 launch 1 3
@30000 stoptrk 2
@100000 stop
@102000 launch 2 0
@130000 stop
